{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Quest log: a client that announces 0x8F6 abandons slot 40 and queries POIs for 30 quests",
  "contract": [
    "A client that sent HELLO (0x8F6) addresses quest log slots up to 63: CMSG_QUESTLOG_REMOVE_QUEST (404) for slot 40 abandons the 41st quest (475).",
    "CMSG_QUEST_POI_QUERY (483) may name more than 25 quests for such a client: a query for 30 quests is answered with SMSG_QUEST_POI_QUERY_RESPONSE (484), which carries the POIs of quests in extended slots, such as 318 (slot 25, one POI), 319 (slot 26, eleven POIs) and 421 (slot 29, four POIs)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "quest_log_size": 64,
